	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d11r0501_assistantw_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わあ！　こんかいの
じっけんは　だいせいこう！▼
ねえねえ　きみ！　この
かいふくのくすりを　どうぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T02:34:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:46:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わあ！　今回の
実験は　大成功！▼
ねえねえ　きみ！　この
かいふくのくすりを　どうぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T02:38:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:46:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手処理
　No028「げんきのかけら」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:47:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ASSISTANTM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
